    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1082340/extras/fd58e6c1483c323e6f9832d3883ccd6f.avif?t=1647893291\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1082340/extras/601bab39a98890f441f331319ad0f349.poster.avif?t=1647893291\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1082340/extras/601bab39a98890f441f331319ad0f349.webm?t=1647893291\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1082340/extras/601bab39a98890f441f331319ad0f349.mp4?t=1647893291\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Fight opponents inside the arena in epic anime-style fights. Power-ups, devastating techniques, transformations, and more await!<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1082340/extras/90693e8302aaf044f2eda0e966d9b3cc.avif?t=1647893291\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1082340/extras/570ea86388ed0033b76bc542da98cf83.poster.avif?t=1647893291\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1082340/extras/570ea86388ed0033b76bc542da98cf83.webm?t=1647893291\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1082340/extras/570ea86388ed0033b76bc542da98cf83.mp4?t=1647893291\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Choose one of the five elemental-themed classes. Use the powers of fire, water, air, lightning, and earth to distinguish your character. <br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1082340/extras/42685711824a54a41688ff6b574e0656.avif?t=1647893291\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1082340/extras/cde0c5fe387c0a92d329270c7adb46c3.poster.avif?t=1647893291\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1082340/extras/cde0c5fe387c0a92d329270c7adb46c3.webm?t=1647893291\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1082340/extras/cde0c5fe387c0a92d329270c7adb46c3.mp4?t=1647893291\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Want to design a character with blue flames? Perhaps you prefer red lightning? Green ethereal swords? Using the character customization system, this is all possible! <br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1082340/extras/7eff74e22b50d0b2875ba2a5d77c2a23.avif?t=1647893291\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1082340/extras/b5bf7d6ad946d74ae568f26eacdb9173.poster.avif?t=1647893291\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1082340/extras/b5bf7d6ad946d74ae568f26eacdb9173.webm?t=1647893291\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1082340/extras/b5bf7d6ad946d74ae568f26eacdb9173.mp4?t=1647893291\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Tired of fighting? Participate in a variety of training activities to level up and increase the power level of your character.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1082340/extras/13c97d57314d0993789ec1e3604263e8.avif?t=1647893291\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1082340/extras/37789bd29864ed2b8afd24c89af4d1fa.poster.avif?t=1647893291\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1082340/extras/37789bd29864ed2b8afd24c89af4d1fa.webm?t=1647893291\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1082340/extras/37789bd29864ed2b8afd24c89af4d1fa.mp4?t=1647893291\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Explore Atlas City and meet friends and foes along your journey. Interact and speak with fellow fighters before you demolish them in the arena.",
